      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8e1edab6",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "target_community",
      "description": "The intended audience is individuals who are familiar with or susceptible to antisemitic conspiracy theories, particularly those who may be exposed to or propagate historical antisemitic tropes such as the 'Jewish Question' or the 'Protocols of the Elders of Zion'. The meme targets those who might interpret the image of Sigmund Freud (a Jewish psychoanalyst) as a symbol for Jews associated with Russia, and who may be influenced by the antisemitic trope of questioning whether Jews are 'in the room' or present in society. The audience is likely to be those who consume or share content that leverages historical antisemitism, conspiracy theories, or stereotypes about Jewish people based on their ethnicity and national origin.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
